# Content collections

Files under `src/collections/<name>/` become Eleventy collections via frontmatter `tags`.

## Blog-style (rendered pages)

```yaml
---
title: Post title
date: created
tags: blog-posts
layout: markdown.hbs
---
```

## FAQ-style (data for partials)

```yaml
---
title: Question text?
tags: faqs
---
```

Body markdown becomes `item.content`; title is `item.data.title`.

## Rules

- `tags` value must match the collection folder purpose (`blog-posts`, `faqs`, or a new agreed name).
- New collection name → update any partial/page that references `collections.<tag>`.
- Prefer `markdown.hbs` when the file should be its own URL with typography.
